      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, mix the olive oil, Worcestershire sauce, turmeric, mustard, and garlic.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange the chicken breast halves in a medium baking dish, and top each with 2 halves bacon. Brush with the glaze.",
